{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "mobile-clinic-api-collection",
		"name": "Mobile Clinic Management API",
		"description": "Complete API collection for Mobile Clinic Management System\n\n## Overview\nThis collection contains all the APIs for the mobile clinic management system including:\n- Authentication & Authorization\n- Patient Management\n- Appointment Scheduling\n- Prescription Management\n- Payment & Invoice System\n- File Upload & Management\n\n## Base URL\n`{{base_url}}/api/method/mob_clinic.mob_clinic.api`\n\n## Authentication\nMost endpoints require authentication. Use the login endpoint first to get session cookies.\n\n## Environment Variables\nSet up these variables in your Postman environment:\n- `base_url`: Your Frappe site URL (e.g., http://localhost:8000)\n- `practitioner_email`: Doctor's email for testing\n- `patient_id`: Test patient ID\n- `appointment_id`: Test appointment ID\n- `prescription_id`: Test prescription ID\n- `invoice_id`: Test invoice ID\n- `file_id`: Test file ID",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
